            "line": 316,
            "text": "theorem stressFree_angular_lag_algebra\n    (x L φ φx φxx : ℝ) (hφ : φ ≠ 0) :\n    x * (-2 * L * (φxx * φ - φx ^ 2) / φ ^ 2) +\n      (2 + x * φx / φ) * (-2 * L * φx / φ) =\n      -2 * L * (x * φxx + 2 * φx) / φ"
